&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTF7-PJjHsMM3KBOpFV_QEmJvBYbS1aI1jf5UCHvL0b9Q&oe=6B0DBAE4"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 3.png", "id": "1517280293482858", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_1517280296816191_3248062158835930793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=stc26EzQbccQ7kNvwH2O8vu&_nc_oc=AdrL-pKWhQK7M-PBUTpiwmvFGo-_oVJ_FE95Me0d2CERhaOmTSLR7kW20SY_S6yUL80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSrJp290EFJFzEsOgkEATP6ixzamJWCN0DfWunDy6WL_g&oe=6B0DCA8D"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 4.png", "id": "2180576715838619", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620985_2180576719171952_4179132521064836612_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bPd-x08MUgYQ7kNvwH5VvB9&_nc_oc=Ado4yutP8KttqXf_P5HBbg5Qg4HhAE7B-PQP9ZGFmxnleeDwB-sY6mjO-yV8-cf39z4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTyyPEtNoThXOVcH9lJgnb8DoeRxG-mL9WXZLIc_zafLQ&oe=6B0D9B26"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 5.png", "id": "1342847194692771", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622162_1342847198026104_6158502527951782000_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UY-k1mq6INgQ7kNvwFhWCes&_nc_oc=AdqxNktzeWPgwICwad6tuv6JkKPVQWUrOnmgaj7my0kxM6qt57WAWai-8jw8hcr6Kpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTrRCD21I-2VqambXnvlSR3B_t1-2PucICgwRzv8gyaUg&oe=6B0DAC11"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "hvac personal thumbnail.png", "id": "1365445488881358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1365445492214691_7647014581930130160_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q3_I77MMd4MQ7kNvwGj3Pea&_nc_oc=AdoNgoCumS-HW0Cju8gsDak5HCo1_krqbs1vctTMlV4FgpBw5yg3twGan-MCBWyT9Uw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS6Na2dqVhcJC0tyEEKD2kEbkFNkhxJMEsU9eEnJI2tsw&oe=6B0DD274"}, "display_name": "Skillveri HVAC Simulator-Personal Use", "keywords": ["skillveri", "hvac", "simulator", "cte", "vr"], "long_description": "The simulation technology that powers workforce training in the world\u2019s leading industries, now in a personal use version for individuals!\nStep into a fully immersive HVAC training environment with Skillveri HVAC Simulator - Personal Use edition.\n\nForget watching videos - start doing. Using Skillveri\u2019s advanced hand-tracking technology, you can perform all actions naturally with your hands, just as you would in the field - no controllers needed!\n\nThe realistic VR simulation for aspiring HVAC techs, this Personal version offers you hands-on practice anytime, anywhere.\n\nImmerse yourself in a realistic scenario and navigate complex tasks with ease using visual cues and step by step instructions.\n\nThis Personal version contains:\n- Commercial HVAC Cleaning and Maintenance\n- Residential HVAC Leak Testing\n\nReady to scale your training or adopt it for your institution? For our fully-loaded Enterprise version, perfect for schools and training institutions, contact us at usa@skillveri.com. Skillveri simulators are used across 100+ schools and colleges across the USA in their CTE programs.", "short_description": "Master HVAC skills in immersive VR - no risk, no tools, no wastage. Perform all actions with your hands exactly as in real life - no VR controllers needed! Perfect for building real-world confidence before stepping onto a job site.\n\nIn this Personal Use edition, learn Commercial HVAC cleaning & Residential HVAC leak testing inside realistic 3D environments. Hands-on practice - anytime, anywhere, at your own pace.\n\nWrite to usa@skillveri.com for the Enterprise version for schools or institutions."}]}, "developer_name": "Skillveri Inc", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skillveri.com/kelvin-lite-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_u